et the over  9000 wait  limit mod also made by Jessamine  relieves your burdens Lidia style by  letting me turn up he'll carry weight  limit to over 9,000 it's over 9 yeah all  the way up to 9999 if you so choose in  fact if you want to take full advantage  of your new weight limit you may also  want to install the increased creature  loot mod from mines pillar 316 this mod  ensures that monsters and creatures will  always drop at least one piece of loot  and the drop chances for unique hides  and natural ingredients are increased  but this one could be a killer if you  don't have the previous mod installed if  you're one of those people who likes to  mod all the way or not at all then  witcher 3 hunters configure by melek  taus is the one for you  hunters config lets you get right down  to it with a tool for configuring and  tweaking a number of hidden settings in  the game which include audio gameplay  rendering and well basically every  setting you can dream of wanting to  configure if you love tabs and sliders  download hunter's config The Witcher 3  game world is pretty dangerous as it is  but if danger is your middle name and  you want to kick it into overdrive then  you may want to check out extreme  weather conditions by KNG extreme  weather should make you feel like even  more of the batter since now you can  fight off beasties and save maidens in  the pouring rain with low visibility  this mod makes winds stronger clouds  darker and thunderstorms way way more  terrifying  if scary is what you're after though the  Haunted spike island in the middle of a  wild storm is probably your best bet  sauna project red have confirmed that  they'll be releasing official modding  tools for The Witcher 3 before too long  so all this is just the tip of the  iceberg let me know down in that comment  section what mods you'd like to see for  The Witcher 3 and I'll catch again next  week
 

